          <section class="shape-block" id="sheet-38-shapes">
            <h3 class="shape-title">図形・テキストボックス内テキスト（14件）</h3>
            <p class="shape-note">画面遷移図・フロー図・画面イメージ上の注釈など、図形内の文字を読み順（位置）で抽出したものです。</p>
            <div class="item-table-wrap">
              <table class="item-table shape-table">
                <thead>
                  <tr><th>位置</th><th>テキスト</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr data-shape-index="1" data-shape-ref="AU7"><td class="shape-ref">AU7</td><td><a class="item-no" href="#item-sheet-38-5">(5)</a></td></tr>
                  <tr data-shape-index="2" data-shape-ref="AR8"><td class="shape-ref">AR8</td><td><a class="item-no" href="#item-sheet-38-6">(6)</a></td></tr>
                  <tr data-shape-index="3" data-shape-ref="D11"><td class="shape-ref">D11</td><td><a class="item-no" href="#item-sheet-38-1">(1)</a></td></tr>
                  <tr data-shape-index="4" data-shape-ref="D12"><td class="shape-ref">D12</td><td><a class="item-no" href="#item-sheet-38-2">(2)</a></td></tr>
                  <tr data-shape-index="5" data-shape-ref="C13"><td class="shape-ref">C13</td><td><a class="item-no" href="#item-sheet-38-4">(4)</a></td></tr>
